{"repositoryId":1413926647,"availability":"available","full":"suryasticsai/steerradar","name":"steerradar","description":"Find a way to your destination 😇💚 ","category":"Other","language":"JavaScript","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-11T04:36:02Z","updated":"2026-10-12T18:48:34Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://suryasticsai.github.io/steerradar/","topics":[],"demo":"https://suryasticsai.github.io/Steeradar/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T19:08:52.035Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-12T19:08:52.035Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-12T19:08:52.035Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-12T19:08:52.035Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Live community rides. Peer chat. Local mesh. Universal DB.","A vehicle-gated, modular, serverless-first community network — built in plain HTML, CSS & JavaScript.","Steeradar is a community movement protocol. Any group that repeats a local journey — a bus route, a carpool, a jogging pack, a walk, a delivery run, an event shuttle — gets a live, discoverable lane that anyone nearby can join."],"features":["The app unlocks only after a valid vehicle number. It becomes your identity — your lanes, your Hive posts, your peer ID.","Optional onboarding step for your photo, vehicle photo, number plate and UPI QR. Previews stay on your device; when signed in they are backed up as private Drive files.","Bright OpenFreeMap canvas with emoji markers for every active lane. Real-time movement animations, pulsing rings, filters: Live now · All · Has seats · My lanes.","Editorial cards with animated occupancy rings, vehicle-type badges, route previews, fare tags, and one-tap Chat / Track / Request. Edit your own lanes inline.","Tap Track on any lane → OSRM routing draws the real driving path to your pickup, with live distance, ETA, and seat count in a floating HUD."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/suryasticsai/steerradar/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint